1
00:00:00,996 --> 00:00:07,716
Welcome to Supply Flow. This video shows nurses everything they need, step by step, in a simple way.

2
00:00:08,167 --> 00:00:13,037
Open the system link. Write your name and your password, then tap Sign in.

3
00:00:13,505 --> 00:00:21,129
On the New request page, there are three choices at the top. One: Doctor request, for supplies used by one doctor.

4
00:00:21,129 --> 00:00:28,752
The doctor must approve it. Two: Clinic consumables, for supplies used by the whole clinic, and for sterilization.

5
00:00:28,752 --> 00:00:35,105
No doctor approval is needed. Three: Send to lab, for patient work that goes to the dental lab.

6
00:00:35,555 --> 00:00:41,695
Let's start with a Doctor request. Choose the doctor. The clinic and the branch are filled in for you.

7
00:00:42,145 --> 00:00:48,505
Choose the type. Monthly is your normal monthly order. Emergency is only for urgent needs.

8
00:00:48,956 --> 00:00:54,426
Now add the items. Tap the search box, write part of the name, and tap the item.

9
00:00:55,832 --> 00:00:58,782
Use plus and minus to set how many you need.

10
00:00:59,632 --> 00:01:07,072
Check the summary on the side, then tap Submit request. Your draft is saved by itself, so you never lose your work.

11
00:01:07,522 --> 00:01:13,444
Next, Clinic consumables. Use it for things the whole clinic uses, like gloves or cotton.

12
00:01:13,444 --> 00:01:18,102
Choose Clinic consumables, then choose your clinic, and add the items.

13
00:01:18,552 --> 00:01:24,932
Tap Submit request. This request goes straight to procurement. It does not wait for a doctor.

14
00:01:25,383 --> 00:01:31,449
Sterilization supplies are ordered the same way, as Clinic consumables. Open the clinic list.

15
00:01:31,449 --> 00:01:38,103
The Sterilization section is at the top. Choose the sterilization of your branch: Buraydah or Unayzah.

16
00:01:38,554 --> 00:01:44,244
A note shows exactly where the order will be delivered. Add the items and tap Submit request.

17
00:01:47,081 --> 00:01:54,268
Now open My requests. Here you can see the difference. The doctor request shows Doctor review: it waits for the doctor.

18
00:01:54,268 --> 00:01:59,221
The clinic and sterilization requests show New: they went straight to procurement.

19
00:01:59,671 --> 00:02:06,531
Tap Details to see everything about a request: each step and its time, the items, and the comments.

20
00:02:06,982 --> 00:02:12,219
The doctor gets an email automatically. Ask the doctor to open their page and approve.

21
00:02:12,219 --> 00:02:15,142
You can also write a comment here as a reminder.

22
00:02:15,592 --> 00:02:20,612
This is the doctor's page. The doctor sees the requests that are waiting for approval.

23
00:02:23,895 --> 00:02:30,325
The doctor opens the request. The doctor can change a quantity or add a note, and then taps Approve.

24
00:02:30,782 --> 00:02:35,551
After approval, procurement prepares the order and sends it to your branch.

25
00:02:35,551 --> 00:02:38,412
You get an alert, and the request shows Sent.

26
00:02:41,280 --> 00:02:47,290
When the box arrives, open My requests and tap Receive and sign. Check each quantity.

27
00:02:47,290 --> 00:02:50,330
If something is missing, change the number.

28
00:02:50,781 --> 00:02:56,971
Sign in the box with your finger, then tap Confirm receipt. A receipt with your signature is saved.

29
00:02:57,421 --> 00:03:03,809
Now, sending work to the lab. Choose Send to lab, choose the doctor, and write the patient file number.

30
00:03:03,809 --> 00:03:08,151
The scan date is today. Change it only if the scan was on another day.

31
00:03:08,602 --> 00:03:14,705
Add the work: choose the lab, the type of work, and write notes, like the tooth number and the shade.

32
00:03:14,705 --> 00:03:19,902
You can add a photo for each work. The date the lab must finish is calculated for you.

33
00:03:20,352 --> 00:03:24,002
Tap Send to lab. Now you can follow it on the Lab page.

34
00:03:24,459 --> 00:03:30,348
When the lab finishes, it sends the work back to the clinic. You will see the button Confirm receipt.

35
00:03:30,348 --> 00:03:32,739
Tap it when the work reaches your clinic.

36
00:03:33,190 --> 00:03:40,995
That's all. Doctor requests need the doctor's approval. Clinic and sterilization requests go straight to procurement.

37
00:03:40,995 --> 00:03:47,400
Lab work goes to the lab. If there is any problem, use the Report button on the card. Thank you!
